# Lumail.io
> The AI-native email platform for newsletters, automations, and transactional email.

Full markdown concatenation of every published docs page.

# Documentation
Source: https://lumail.io/docs.md

Lumail is email marketing for creators and small teams. Start with how the product works. Use [Guides](/docs/guides) when you want a path, or [API Reference](/docs/api-reference/v2) when you want endpoints.

